    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框使用 macOS 标准编辑快捷键。对话框共用上方的应用 / 取消快捷键。数值框使用上下方向键调整，按住 Shift 可增大步长。macOS 标准命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在非录制状态下始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text · Double-click to edit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键需要搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，以免影响正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
